@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+# Process audit — S5-CLM-00003519
+
+The generation used only the immutable files enumerated by its claim card and
+the eighteen claim-owned output paths. The prior-generation package and its
+Master repair diagnostic were rematerialized solely through the explicitly
+listed immutable checkpoint bootstrap. The generation did not inspect the
+canonical repository or any predecessor/sibling task root, and it did not
+invoke Lean, Lake, Elan, clone, fetch, or any network fallback.
+
+The proof is claim-owned. The frozen Formal Conjectures declaration is used only
+as exact statement authority: its proof body contains `sorryAx` and is never
+called by `rank_2_2_machine`. Each Lean surface imports the exact routed module
+and actively references the exact qualified provider declaration. The audit
+surface repeats the independent proof so that provider-native isolated
+compilation cannot accidentally obtain proof authority from a local wrapper.
+
+The worker gate is the claim-card command with `--no-lean`. Trust-zero Lean
+elaboration, the transitive declaration census, object/read tracing, cold
+from-source replay, reproduction of the corrected terminal axiom report, and
+mutation replay remain mandatory Master recomputations after harvest; no worker
+receipt is represented as canonical acceptance.
