+# S5-CLM-00003519
+
+This package closes the known rank-one exceptional case of Fernandes' family:
+`gammaSubgroup 2 2` is generated by the pair of transpositions. The Lean root
+is a local proof, while the frozen Formal Conjectures theorem is used only to
+bind the exact proposition.
+
+The package includes the bidirectional semantic crosswalk, anchored proof DAG,
+M0-L closure proposal, readable reconstruction with reverse coverage, worker
+validation trace, and provisional release decision. `master_accepted` remains
+false until the canonical Master independently recompiles in the sealed Lean
+4.27 provider checkout, reproduces the terminal axiom report `[propext,
+Classical.choice, Quot.sound]`, recomputes semantic/dependency hashes and
+mutations, and accepts the integration.
